---
description: >-
  `autonumber both` on arrows that don't end on a plain lifeline: activation
  boxes, and the boxes of created and destroyed participants on either side of
  the sender, where the number goes next to the box.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber both
  create participant Bob
  Alice->>Bob: Created on the left
  Alice->>+Bob: Activates Bob
  Bob-->>-Alice: Deactivates Bob
  activate Alice
  Alice->>Bob: From an active participant
  Bob->>Alice: Into an active participant
  deactivate Alice
  create participant Carl
  Alice->>Carl: Created on the right
  create actor Dan
  Carl-xDan: Created actor
  destroy Carl
  Carl->>Alice: Sender destroyed
  destroy Dan
  Alice-xDan: Receiver destroyed
  destroy Bob
  Alice-xBob: Destroyed on the left
